105A  AD 51 C0     LDA TXTSET
105D  20 58 FC     JSR HOME
1060  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1063  8D C9 CE D3  hiasc "\rINSTRUCTIONS FOR HI-RES ADVENTURE\r\r\r"
1088  00           .byte $00
1089  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
108C  C1 C4 D6 C5  hiasc "ADVENTURE IS ONE OF THE MOST FACINATING\rAND CHALLENGING GAMES AVAILABLE FOR\rYOUR APPLE COMPUTER. WINNING IS QUITE\rA CHALLENGE IN A GAME WHERE IT MAY TAKE\r"
1126  00           .byte $00
1127  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
112A  C8 CF D5 D2  hiasc "HOURS TO MOVE AND WEEKS TO SOLVE A \rPUZZLE. HI-RES ADVENTURE #1 ('MYSTERY\rHOUSE') TAKES PLACE IN AN OLD HOUSE\r"
1198  00           .byte $00
1199  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
119C  D7 C9 D4 C8  hiasc "WITH MANY ROOMS. AS YOU ENTER THE\rHOUSE, SEVEN OTHER PERSONS WILL BE\rIN THE LIVING ROOM. EVENTUALLY THEY\rARE DISPERSED THROUGHOUT THE HOUSE AND\r"
122C  00           .byte $00
122D  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1230  D9 CF D5 A0  hiasc "YOU START FINDING THEM - DEAD! YOU MUST\rFIND THE KILLER BEFORE HE(SHE?) ENDS UP\rKILLING YOU.\r\r"
128E  00           .byte $00
128F  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1292  D0 D2 C5 D3  hiasc "PRESS RETURN TO CONTINUE"
12AA  00           .byte $00
12AB  20 6F FD     JSR GETLN1
12AE  20 58 FC     JSR HOME
12B1  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
12B4  8D 8D D9 CF  hiasc "\r\rYOU PROGRESS THROUGH THE HOUSE BY\r"
12D8  00           .byte $00
12D9  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
12DC  D0 D2 CF D6  hiasc "PROVIDING TWO WORD COMMANDS WHICH \rUSUALLY CONTAIN A VERB AND THEN A \rNOUN BUT AREN'T ALWAYS IN THAT ORDER.\r"
1348  00           .byte $00
1349  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
134C  C5 D8 C1 CD  hiasc "EXAMPLES ARE 'WATER ON' AND 'OPEN\rDOOR'. IF A SET OF WORDS DOESNT SEEM\rTO BE WORKING TRY DIFFERENT TERMINOLOGY\r\r"
13BC  00           .byte $00
13BD  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
13C0  C9 C6 A0 D9  hiasc "IF YOU SHOULD FIND A STAIRCASE YOU MAY\rTRY 'UP STAIRS' OR 'GO STAIRS'.\r"
1407  00           .byte $00
1408  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
140B  D3 CF CD C5  hiasc "SOME OF THE ACTIONS YOU CAN TAKE ARE\rGET, DROP, GO, LOOK, READ, CLIMB\rMOVE, HIT, KILL ETC.\r\r"
1467  00           .byte $00
1468  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
146B  D0 D2 C5 D3  hiasc "PRESS RETURN TO CONTINUE"
1483  00           .byte $00
1484  20 6F FD     JSR GETLN1
1487  20 58 FC     JSR HOME
148A  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
148D  8D 8D 8D 8D  hiasc "\r\r\r\r\rYOU MAY GO IN THE DIRECTIONS NORTH, \rSOUTH, EAST, WEST, UP AND DOWN. TYPE\rNORTH OR N TO GO NORTH. THE OTHER\r"
14FE  00           .byte $00
14FF  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1502  C4 C9 D2 C5  hiasc "DIRECTIONS MAY ALSO BE ABBREVIATED AS\rWELL. WHEN YOUR WAY IS BLOCKED AND\rYOU CAN'T USE DIRECTIONS TO MOVE \r"
156D  00           .byte $00
156E  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1571  D9 CF D5 A0  hiasc "YOU MAY HAVE TO REFER TO THE ACTUAL\rOBJECT IN YOUR WAY. IN THESE CASES\rYOU COULD TYPE 'GO DOOR', 'GO HOLE',\r'GO GATE' ETC.\r\r"
15ED  00           .byte $00
15EE  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
15F1  D0 D2 C5 D3  hiasc "PRESS RETURN TO CONTINUE"
1609  00           .byte $00
160A  20 6F FD     JSR GETLN1
160D  20 58 FC     JSR HOME
1610  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1613  8D 8D 8D C9  hiasc "\r\r\rIN GENERAL THE TOP OF THE SCREEN IS\rNORTH. THE BOTTOM IS SOUTH, THE LEFT\rSIDE IS WEST AND THE RIGHT SIDE IS\r"
1682  00           .byte $00
1683  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1686  C5 C1 D3 D4  hiasc "EAST. BECAUSE OF THE DIFFICULTY OF\rDRAWING DOORWAYS TO THE SOUTH OR THE\rBOTTOM OF THE SCREEN, THERE ARE ONE\r"
16F2  00           .byte $00
16F3  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
16F6  CF D2 A0 D4  hiasc "OR TWO ROOMS WHERE THE DOORWAYS DO NOT\rMATCH UP TO THE NORMAL DIRECTIONS.\r\r"
1741  00           .byte $00
1742  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1745  C9 C6 A0 D9  hiasc "IF YOU WANT A CLOSER LOOK AT SOMETHING\rSAY LOOK (OBJECT). TO RETURN TO THE\rMAIN VIEW SAY LOOK ROOM.\r\r"
17AA  00           .byte $00
17AB  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
17AE  D3 C1 D6 C5  hiasc "SAVE GAME AND RESTORE GAME MAY\rALSO BE USED.\r\r\rPRESS RETURN TO CONTINUE"
17F5  00           .byte $00
17F6  20 6F FD     JSR GETLN1
17F9  20 58 FC     JSR HOME
17FC  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
17FF  8D 8D 8D C1  hiasc "\r\r\rA NOTE OF CAUTION: CARRYING MORE THAN\rONE NOTE MAY BE CONFUSING AS THE"
1848  00           .byte $00
1849  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
184C  8D C3 CF CD  hiasc "\rCOMPUTER WILL ARBITRARILY DECIDE WHICH\rONE TO READ OR DROP.\r\r"
188A  00           .byte $00
188B  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
188E  D3 C8 CF D5  hiasc "SHOULD YOU WISH TO REVIEW PAST COMMANDS\rYOU MAY PRESS RETURN WITHOUT TYPING TO\r"
18DD  00           .byte $00
18DE  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
18E1  C6 CC C9 D0  hiasc "FLIP/FLOP BETWEEN GRAPHICS AND TEXT.\r\rIF YOUR COPY SHOULD EVER FAIL TO LOAD\r(OR GET MUNCHED BY A HUNGRY DISK DRIVE)\r"
1955  00           .byte $00
1956  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
1959  D3 C5 CE C4  hiasc "SEND IT WITH FIVE DOLLARS TO:\r\r"
1978  00           .byte $00
1979  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
197C  A0 A0 A0 A0  hiasc "     ON-LINE SYSTEMS\r     36575 MUDGE RANCH ROAD\r"
19AD  00           .byte $00
19AE  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
19B1  A0 A0 A0 A0  hiasc "     COARSEGOLD CA. 93614\r\r"
19CC  00           .byte $00
19CD  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
19D0  8D 8D 8D D0  hiasc "\r\r\rPRESS RETURN TO CONTINUE"
19EB  00           .byte $00
19EC  20 6F FD     JSR GETLN1
19EF  20 58 FC     JSR HOME
19F2  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
19F5  8D 8D        hiasc "\r\r"
19F7  00           .byte $00
19F8  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
19FB  C1 D4 A0 D4  hiasc "AT THE START OF THE GAME THERE\r"
1A1A  00           .byte $00
1A1B  20 15 1C     JSR rt_print
